# Stage 20.4 Closure Run

This directory holds Stage 20.4 output: a deterministic closure
audit + Stage 21 handoff packet produced from Stage 20.2 / Stage
20.3 input run directories.

## Identity

- Closure run ID: {{run_id}}
- Generated at (UTC): {{generated_at_utc}}
- Stage 20.4 minor version: {{stage20_4_minor_version}}
- Handoff contract version: {{handoff_contract_version}}

## Closure status

- closure_status: {{closure_status}}
- safe_for_live_dispatch: false (hardcoded; never operator-overridable)
- live_dispatch_ready: false (hardcoded; never operator-overridable)

## Artifacts in this directory

- stage20_closure_manifest.json -- top-level closure record
- stage20_closure_checklist.csv -- 28-row pass/fail/warning checklist
- codebase_audit_report.json -- per-file audit hits
- stage20_2_lineage.json -- Stage 20.2 artifact hashes recorded by closure
- stage20_3_lineage.json -- Stage 20.3 artifact hashes + crosscheck result
- stage21_handoff.md -- contract for Stage 21
- stage20_4_run.log -- JSON-lines event log of this closure run

## What Stage 20.4 will NOT do

- Run pytest (operator supplies test results)
- Invoke git (no subprocess, no shell-out)
- Create the stage-20-closed tag (manual operator step)
- Touch network, env vars, providers, Discord, Telegram, sqlite
- Mutate Stage 20.2 or Stage 20.3 run directories

## Next steps

See stage21_handoff.md Section H for the manual operator workflow.
